# Auto-push GitHub Pages

This folder is the deploy root for `schmidtaiwan/line-progress`.

When a change to this site is finished, push it in the same turn. Do not stop after local edits and wait for a separate「推上去」.

1. Bump `PAGE_BUILD` in `index.html` (and `架線進度_Google.html` when that copy exists). Set `PAGE_DATE` to today if it is not already.
2. Commit only the files for this change.
3. `git push origin main`. Normal push only. Do not force-push unless the user asks.
4. Tell the user the live URL: https://schmidtaiwan.github.io/line-progress/ and that they should Ctrl+F5.

Do not commit progress JSON, `__pycache__`, scratch scripts, or secrets. `google_config.js` Client ID may stay in the repo (public SPA client).
